    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9066" root="حمر" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِمِرٌّ</span></b>  <i>Violent</i> rain, (S,) <i>such as removes the superficial part of the ground.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A <i>severe</i>
night-journey to water. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  The <i>most copious portion</i> of rain; and <i>violence</i> thereof. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  (assumed tropical:)  The <i>violence, vehemence,</i> or <i>intenseness,</i> of
anything; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِمِرَّةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُمْرَةٌ</span></b> . (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَمَارَّةٌ</span>, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  Also The <i>evil,</i>
or <i>mischief,</i> of a man. (K.)

